{"work_id": "MX4-070", "matched_key": "唯心历史观的破产", "normalized_offset": 0, "normalized_context": "唯心历史观的破产1511的道理是不能设想会发生革命的但是却早已发生了3按照艾奇逊的说法中国是毫无出路的人口有了四亿七千五百万是一种不堪负担的压力革命也好不革命也好总之是不得了艾奇逊在这里寄予了很大的希望这个希望他没有说出来却被许多美国新闻记者经常地透露了出来这就是所谓中国共产党解决不了自己的经济问题中国将永远是天下大乱只有靠美国的面粉即是说变为美国的殖民地才有出路辛亥革命4为什么没有成功没有解决吃饭问题呢是因为辛亥革命只推翻一个清朝政府而没有推翻帝国主义和封建主义的压迫和", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-980973716441b9197629", "source_url": "https://ebook.dswxyjy.org.cn/dswxbooks/storage/files/20220801/36e607c0457c68b8f6cca39f64231ccb9989/mobile/javascript/search_config.js", "raw_sha256": "c4ad80b15f7c7bde2dac26caec6024460d6775ac4c04a8a0c17b3dc6f45c201c", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-official", "volume": 4, "basis": "official_book_landing_and_reader_configuration"}], "kind": "reader_page", "number": 401, "end": 401, "record_path": "archive/records/A-980973716441b9197629.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-980973716441b9197629.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东选集（第四卷）〔官方阅读器全文文字层〕", "source_media": "official_page_text", "source_layer": "official_reader_text", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-a088ddc98c6ad165", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
{"work_id": "MX4-070", "matched_key": "唯心历史观的破产", "normalized_offset": 0, "normalized_context": "唯心历史观的破产1513在不明事理的中国人看来艾奇逊说得很有点像西方的新观念输入了中国引起了革命革什么人的命呢因为清朝统治的衰落向弱点进攻是革清朝的命了艾奇逊在这里说得不恰当辛亥革命是革帝国主义的命中国人所以要革清朝的命是因为清朝是帝反对英法联军国主义的走狗反对英国鸦片侵略的战争6侵略的战争7反对帝国主义走狗清朝的太平天国战争8反对法国侵略的战争910反对八国反对日本侵略的战争联军侵略的战争11都失败了于是再有反对帝国主义走狗清朝的辛亥革命这就是到辛亥为止的近代中国史艾奇", "cue_words": [], "title_form_signal": "near_page_heading", "witness_id": "A-980973716441b9197629", "source_url": "https://ebook.dswxyjy.org.cn/dswxbooks/storage/files/20220801/36e607c0457c68b8f6cca39f64231ccb9989/mobile/javascript/search_config.js", "raw_sha256": "c4ad80b15f7c7bde2dac26caec6024460d6775ac4c04a8a0c17b3dc6f45c201c", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "maoxuan-official", "volume": 4, "basis": "official_book_landing_and_reader_configuration"}], "kind": "reader_page", "number": 403, "end": 403, "record_path": "archive/records/A-980973716441b9197629.json", "text_path": "archive/text/A-980973716441b9197629.txt", "source_title": "毛泽东选集（第四卷）〔官方阅读器全文文字层〕", "source_media": "official_page_text", "source_layer": "official_reader_text", "edition_verification_status": "not_independently_verified", "public_url_rechecked_this_run": false, "family": "maoxuan", "id": "C-c2cac4a2797182db", "status": "candidate_only_not_work_identity_revision_or_causation", "normalization": "NFKC plus letters/digits only; context is NOT a verbatim quote"}
